// cart handling from here
### Create user cart
POST http://localhost:4000/api/carts/create

### Get cart
GET http://localhost:4000/api/carts/get-cart

### Clear cart
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/carts/clear-cart



// cart item handling from here
### Add Item to cart 1
POST http://localhost:4000/api/carts/add-item
